.png", "id": "4433944633598660", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_4433944640265326_3429261202004879698_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HVlWuxTQF8kQ7kNvwGGQxSj&_nc_oc=AdqehZTKn5irpq76_uzm8ef8Mb_kBwiaS1q3n1pWfJ1Lsknb5xKAkivPo6kDqF65clM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-oCYW-FGlltoBDdkrOGCttZGl5RQ3f9sgl3UXhLjB1bw&oe=6A3FD901"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00003 2.png", "id": "1358136499494641", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819356_1358136502827974_9023638638628557428_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=__bk825bMe4Q7kNvwHm6JgY&_nc_oc=AdrbMO6VPiR5dB4ofc5XAtJ_ZX8RhNZaiuoSlUZWQ7eDw8On9cFa0UQADzbqeLZHb4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_3HV3fDAlqF3R3vy0G_MMNCjG45qOEe2dxKWk9IZ3C1A&oe=6A3FE24B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Life V-aiR - Serious Game", "keywords": ["AirQuality", "Environment", "SeriousGame", "Puzzle", "cooperation"], "long_description": "# \u26a0\ufe0f READ BEFORE YOU PLAY \u26a0\ufe0f\nThis game is a training tool used by the Life V-aiR project partners to raise decision makers awareness about air quality issues. \nIt is supposed to be played in cooperation with a player outside the headset using a \"Technical Manual\".\nIf you're interested in playing, please contact the developer of the game ! \n# How to play\nIf you already know the concept of the game, please download the Technical Manual on this page : \nhttps://tinyurl.com/LifeVaiRTechnicalManuals\n\n# Project maintainer \nPlease for any informations on how to play or to deploy it on your territory, contact the maintainer of the game here : \nhttps://tinyurl.com/LifeVairContact", "short_description": "Life V-aiR is a serious game developed to raise awareness of people about air quality issues\nA external document is required to play the game as intended."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id":